# Template for the private SSH configuration.
#
# The installer copies this to ~/.ssh/config.local, which lives outside the
# repository and is intentionally not versioned. It is preserved on later
# runs. Put private hostnames, addresses, users, identity paths, and
# per-machine overrides there.
#
# Because OpenSSH uses the first value it finds for each setting, entries in
# this file are included before the shared `Host *` defaults and can override
# them for selected hosts.
#
# Host private-example
#   HostName 192.0.2.10
#   User deploy
